        "name": "Fell Rebuke",
        "actionType": "reaction",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>In response to being hit by an attack, Vecna utters a fell word, dealing 10 (3d6) necrotic damage to the attacker, and Vecna teleports, along with any equipment he is wearing or carrying, up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space he can see.</p>",
